<!DOCTYPE html>
<html xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" lang="en">

<head>
    <%- include("head", locals) %>
</head>

<body class="preload">
    <div class="content">
        <div id="logo"><%- inliner('assets/images/svg/logo.svg') %></div>
        <div class="center">
            <a class="addBtn" href="https://discordapp.com/oauth2/authorize?client_id=227435708183216128&scope=bot&permissions=3165184">Add to Discord</a>
        </div>
        <section>
            <div>
                <h1>Taunt&nbsp;Bot</h1>
            </div>
            <div>
                <p>
                    Taunt Bot is a Discord bot that plays your custom audio clips on command and when you join a voice channel. Play your victory anthem when you win. Humble yourself with a lose track. Intro taunts play when you connect to voice chat.
                </p>
            </div>
        </section>
        <section>
            <div>
                <h2>Stats</h2>
            </div>
            <div>
                Connected to 672 Discord guilds
            </div>
            <div>
                123 taunts played this year
            </div>
        </section>
        <section>
            <div>
                <h2>Commands</h2>
            </div>
            <div>
                <h3 class="command">/upload</h3>
                <p class="color-2">Uploads an audio clip to serve as your taunt</p>
            </div>
            <div>
                <h3 class="command">/win</h3>
                <p class="color-2">Plays your "victory" taunt</p>
            </div>
            <div>
                <h3 class="command">/mvp</h3>
                <p class="color-2">Plays your "mvp" taunt</p>
            </div>
            <div>
                <h3 class="command">/lose</h3>
                <p class="color-2">Plays your "lose" taunt</p>
            </div>
            <div>
                <h3 class="command">/stop</h3>
                <p class="color-2">Stops taunt playback early</p>
            </div>
        </section>
        <section>
            <div>
                <h2>Privacy</h2>
            </div>
            <div>
                <p>The only data that is kept is your currently uploaded audio taunts and logs. Delete your taunts using the <span>/delete</span> command.</p>
                <p>Taunt Bot logs taunt plays (what audio file in which server, statistics).</p>
                <p>Your data is never shared or sold.</p>
            </div>
        </section>
        <section>
            <div>
                <h2>Support</h2>
            </div>
            <div>
                Join <a href="/discord">my Discord Guild</a> for assistance.
            </div>
        </section>
        <section>
            <div>
                <h2>Source Code</h2>
            </div>
            <div>
                <p>Taunt Bot is open source, licensed under GPLv3. <a href="https://github.com/CorySanin/tauntbot">Browse the source code</a> on GitHub.</p>
                <p>Available in <a href="https://www.npmjs.com/package/tauntbot">npm</a> and <a href="https://hub.docker.com/r/corysanin/tauntbot">Docker Hub</a>.</p>
            </div>
            <div>
                <p>This website is licensed under MIT. <a href="https://github.com/CorySanin/tauntbot-web">Browse the source code</a> on GitHub.</p>
            </div>
            <div>
                Site and bot developed by <a href="https://sanin.dev/">Cory Sanin</a> AKA <a href="https://whoisworm.com/">WORM</a>
            </div>
        </section>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
